"Run 3: total tilt 0 µm. All three points show \"no change\" — the sensor is "
"perpendicular to the optical axis. This is the target state."
msgstr ""
"Ronde 3: totale kanteling 0 µm. Alle drie de punten vertonen \"geen "
"verandering\" — de sensor staat loodrecht op de optische as. Dit is de "
